<P><FONT SIZE=3D2>Here it is assumed that:</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>\begin{itemize}</FONT>

<BR><FONT SIZE=3D2>\item \verb+\numcite+ and \verb+\numentry+ have {\it =
